1
00:00:00,162 --> 00:00:01,162
(Penny:)Why did you tell Howard

2
00:00:01,163 --> 00:00:02,393
(Penny:)I was hiding
Leonard's things?

3
00:00:02,397 --> 00:00:03,127
(Bernadette:)One sec.

4
00:00:03,131 --> 00:00:04,161
(Bernadette:)Why did you tell Leonard

5
00:00:04,166 --> 00:00:06,296
(Bernadette:)I told you Penny was
hiding his things?!

6
00:00:07,202 --> 00:00:08,302
(Howard:)It just came up

7
00:00:08,303 --> 00:00:10,803
because we-we were talking
about secrets and...

8
00:00:10,806 --> 00:00:12,136
(Howard:)Wait.

9
00:00:13,475 --> 00:00:15,545
(Amy:)Everybody
stop it with that!

10
00:00:16,411 --> 00:00:18,181
(Raj:)I'm not really a part of this,

11
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:20,450
(Raj:)so I'm just gonna dig in.

12
00:00:21,316 --> 00:00:22,716
(Amy:)And I'd like to know
why you blabbed

13
00:00:22,718 --> 00:00:24,218
(Amy:)about my apartment.

14
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:25,589
(Howard:)You're up, blabby.

15
00:00:26,955 --> 00:00:29,625
(Bernadette:)Amy, I'm sorry, I shouldn't
have said anything.

16
00:00:30,525 --> 00:00:32,525
(Amy:)I guess it's okay.

17
00:00:32,527 --> 00:00:34,257
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry

18
00:00:34,263 --> 00:00:36,593
(Amy:)that I lied about
my apartment.

19
00:00:36,598 --> 00:00:38,568
(Sheldon:)It's all right.

20
00:00:38,567 --> 00:00:39,837
(Scene:)And...

21
00:00:39,835 --> 00:00:40,805
(Penny:)And what?

22
00:00:40,802 --> 00:00:42,702
(Penny:)Your wizard robes
are next to go.

23
00:00:44,506 --> 00:00:46,636
(Raj:)Now that everything's
out on the table,

24
00:00:46,642 --> 00:00:49,512
you-you think you two
will keep living together?

25
00:00:50,345 --> 00:00:52,845
(Sheldon:)Despite recent events,

26
00:00:52,848 --> 00:00:54,618
(Sheldon:)I do consider our experiment

27
00:00:54,616 --> 00:00:57,146
(Sheldon:)in cohabitation
to have been positive.

28
00:00:57,152 --> 00:01:00,082
(Amy:)Are you saying you'd like
to live with me?

